Hey everyone! I bring you my development journey on what I have **discovered, accomplishments for this month, and the goals for next month!**

Additionally, I will share some posts highlights on **what post I am proud of sharing to Dev.to** and my **top 3 posts that stood out to me this month!**





&nbsp;

---

# 💫 SPECIAL Announcement (with request to the reader) 💫 

I am proud to announce our DEVengers website! More information coming soon on the release date. Will coordinate with other members in the DEVengers team with more information!

💫 **Find our website here: https://the-devengers-tower.github.io/** 💫

Follow our DEVengers org to meet selected dev.to users who made a change on the platform!

{% embed https://dev.to/devengers %}

&nbsp;

### Request from the Reader

**With that said, I asked all of you to submit your favorite article in the comments that is from you or from another author and tell us why you chose that article!**





&nbsp;

